 41798                           ;	Clock Switch Enable bit
 41799                           ;	CSWEN = ON, Writing to NOSC and NDIV is allowed
 41800                           ;	JTAG Enable bit
 41801                           ;	JTAGEN = OFF, Disable JTAG Boundary Scan mode, JTAG pins revert to user functions
 41802                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor Enable bit
 41803                           ;	FCMEN = ON, Fail-Safe Clock Monitor enabled
 41804                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor -Primary XTAL Enable bit
 41805                           ;	FCMENP = ON, FSCM timer will set FSCMP bit and OSFIF interrupt on Primary XTAL failure
 41806                           ;	Fail-Safe Clock Monitor -Secondary XTAL Enable bit
 41807                           ;	FCMENS = ON, FSCM timer will set FSCMS bit and OSFIF interrupt on Secondary XTAL failu
      +                          re
